  "content": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "anchor": "인물세력생업",
      "depth": 1,
      "text": {
        "en": "Characters, Factions, and Trades",
        "ko": "인물·세력·생업"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "anchor": "인물",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": {
        "en": "Characters",
        "ko": "인물"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "anchor": "인물-p1",
      "text": {
        "en": "A named character has abilities, a trade, injuries, an affiliation, a post, beliefs, and memories of major events. The game does not store the relationship of every pair of characters; it keeps only the relationships that change decisions, such as kinship, master and disciple, command, contract, cooperation, and grudge.",
        "ko": "2126년 십육국에는 대통령·군주·역장·사령관·회장·방장·의장·위원장 등의 직위가 있다. 수장은 각국의 장부와 시설을 관리한다."
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "anchor": "생업",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": {
        "en": "Trades",
        "ko": "생업"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "anchor": "생업-p1",
      "text": {
        "en": "A trade is the work a character does in the world. Before combat is joined, it decides what the character adds to a unit's orders and state. The table supports those seven hands.",
        "ko": "정수장·차량기지·병원·공방·교구에서는 서로 다른 직능의 사람이 당직을 맡았다."
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "anchor": "십육국과-핵심-인물",
      "depth": 2,
      "text": {
        "en": "The Sixteen States and Core Characters",
        "ko": "십육국과 핵심 인물"
